        "TileImage": "$($repository 03a0fe82-bf5a-41b3-8af2-25efed5b2a53).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47. Bangkok&apos;s Himmapan Hotel conceals a ruthless narcotics syndicate. Suzanne Vargas finances the operation, Kasem Sakda provides protection, Lloyd manages distribution, and Marie Hoffmann launders their profits. Their latest deal threatens thousands of lives, while witnesses have begun disappearing. Our client has requested the elimination of all four conspirators. It seems their criminal enterprise has reached its expiration date. Good hunting, 47",
